1164:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_rcc.c **** /**
1165:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Returns the HCLK frequency     
